* A macro argument in a link-time expression of the body (\1+\1+\1+\1(a3)): through an alias
* each call sets before it (.Lr68xm<k>), the same r68x_ names as rof2elf makes of r68's
* references; two lines of one expression, a call repeated, a label on the call, a number, two
* parameters and one negated, a call in another macro's body with that macro's argument.
* fixed: (not committed) 2026-10-10 r68togas: macro arguments in link-time expressions
* expect text: 2f2b0000266b0000 2f2b0000266b0000 2f2b0000266b0000 2f2b0028266b0428 000000000000 2f2b0000266b0000 4e75
* expect reloc: 00000002 R_68K_16          r68x_3fbf59ac
* expect reloc: 00000006 R_68K_16          r68x_3fbf59ac+0x00000400
* expect reloc: 0000000a R_68K_16          r68x_3fbf59ac
* expect reloc: 00000012 R_68K_16          r68x_649e642b
* expect reloc: 00000020 R_68K_32          r68x_b0c80d1f+0x00000008
* expect reloc: 00000024 R_68K_16          r68x_f714269e
* expect reloc: 0000002c R_68K_16          r68x_c6fb34fd+0x00000400
* expect sym: T Here 00000010
* expect nosym: .Lr68xm1
 psect macro_ext_sum,0,0,0,0,0
SVC macro
 move.l \1+\1+\1+\1(a3),-(a7)
